@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
title Biểu đồ lớp thiết kế module Quản trị\nMức mô hình: Implementation
class AdminClient <<Client Component>> {
  + execute(command: AdminCommand): void
}
class AdminServerEntry <<Server Action>> {
  + execute(command: AdminCommand): Promise<ActionResult>
}
class AdminApplicationService <<application service>> {
  + authorize(adminId: String): Promise<void>
  + execute(adminId: String, command: AdminCommand): Promise<void>
}
class UserService <<module API>> { + manageUser(command): Promise<void> }
class GameService <<module API>> { + manageGame(command): Promise<void> }
class OrderService <<module API>> { + manageOrder(command): Promise<void> }
class PromotionService <<module API>> { + managePromotion(command): Promise<void> }
class ReviewService <<module API>> { + moderateReview(command): Promise<void> }

AdminClient ..> AdminServerEntry : gọi
AdminServerEntry ..> AdminApplicationService : điều phối
AdminApplicationService ..> UserService : quản lý người dùng
AdminApplicationService ..> GameService : quản lý trò chơi
AdminApplicationService ..> OrderService : quản lý đơn hàng
AdminApplicationService ..> PromotionService : quản lý khuyến mãi
AdminApplicationService ..> ReviewService : kiểm duyệt đánh giá
@enduml
